# ReelForge / skillificationed
#
# THESE MUST BE THE skillificationed ACCOUNT'S CREDENTIALS, NOT pa1kura's.
#
# ReelForge is a fork of the AI_News pipeline and the working .env was copied
# across with it, so IG_USER_ID, THREADS_USER_ID and BRAND_HANDLE all still
# pointed at @pa1kura as of 2026-09-20. Nothing has posted from here -- there
# is no publisher in this repo yet -- but the moment one is added, countdown
# reels would go out on the AI-news account unless these are repointed first.
#
# Check before wiring up any publishing:
#   IG_USER_ID       must differ from the pa1kura.ai project's
#   THREADS_USER_ID  same
#   BRAND_HANDLE     @skillificationed, not @pa1kura
#
# Shared-by-design, and fine to keep identical: GEMINI_API_KEY, PEXELS_API_KEY,
# BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN. They are per-service quotas, not per-channel identity.

